 ## Design invariants

 - Light mode is the default; dark mode is a first-class twin with the same hierarchy.
-- IBM Plex Sans carries interface copy; IBM Plex Mono carries prices, specifications, identifiers, and aligned numeric data.
-- The canvas remains white/near-black with a restrained crimson primary and semantic green/amber states.
